<title>RUSSIA: Russia share price closes, index not to appear Wed.</title>
<headline>Russia share price closes, index not to appear Wed.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's National Stock Market Participants Association (NAUFOR) said it would not inject share closing prices and the Russian Trading System index on Wednesday due to technical problems.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
